@CreditUnion.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5153

### Check demo session
GET {{CreditUnion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/session
Accept: application/json

###

### Start the fake member session
POST {{CreditUnion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/session/demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"userId": "demo.member",
	"password": "demo123"
}

### Get the signed-in member's account summary
GET {{CreditUnion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/mine
Accept: application/json

### Get the signed-in member's activity
GET {{CreditUnion.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/mine/transactions
Accept: application/json
